{
  "uid": "platform-container-metrics",
  "title": "Platform Containers Metrics",
  "tags": [
    "platform",
    "containers",
    "performance"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "LoadId",
        "label": "Lote",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "Infraestructura",
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "Infraestructura",
          "value": "Infraestructura"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "Infraestructura",
            "value": "Infraestructura"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Environment",
        "label": "Ambiente",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "VictoriaMetrics"
        },
        "query": "label_values(platform_container_up{load_id=~\"${LoadId:regex}\"}, environment)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": false,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "HostName",
        "label": "Contenedor",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "VictoriaMetrics"
        },
        "query": "label_values(platform_container_up{load_id=~\"${LoadId:regex}\",environment=~\"${Environment:regex}\"}, host_name)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": false,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Como leer este dashboard",
      "description": "Guia de uso para metricas de los contenedores Podman de la plataforma.",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Que muestra\nMetricas reales de los contenedores Podman que componen la plataforma: estado, CPU, RAM, red y block I/O.\n\n### Como interpretarlo\n`Platform container up` indica subidas y bajadas. CPU y RAM muestran consumo operativo. Red y block I/O ayudan a detectar actividad o saturacion por componente.\n\n### Accion sugerida\nFiltrar por contenedor cuando haya picos, confirmar si coincide con reinicios o cargas, y revisar Zabbix Latest data del mismo host si falta evidencia.\n\n### Fuente\n`Scripts/UpdatePlatformZabbixStatus.sh` toma `podman stats`, alimenta ZabbixAgent y publica las mismas series en VictoriaMetrics."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Platform container up",
      "description": "Estado historico por contenedor. 1 significa disponible; 0 significa detenido o sin evidencia.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "VictoriaMetrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "last_over_time(platform_container_up{load_id=~\"${LoadId:regex}\",environment=~\"${Environment:regex}\",host_name=~\"${HostName:regex}\"}[30d])",
          "interval": "1m",
          "legendFormat": "{{host_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Filtrar este contenedor",
              "url": "/d/platform-container-metrics/platform-containers-metrics?var-Environment=${__field.labels.environment}&var-HostName=${__field.labels.host_name}"
            }
          ],
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "CPU percent",
      "description": "CPU por contenedor desde podman stats.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "VictoriaMetrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "last_over_time(platform_container_cpu_percent{load_id=~\"${LoadId:regex}\",environment=~\"${Environment:regex}\",host_name=~\"${HostName:regex}\"}[30d])",
          "interval": "1m",
          "legendFormat": "{{host_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Filtrar este contenedor",
              "url": "/d/platform-container-metrics/platform-containers-metrics?var-Environment=${__field.labels.environment}&var-HostName=${__field.labels.host_name}"
            }
          ],
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0
        }
      }
    },
